{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"c4fa1a2f6e7328356637a9a6fcde3f726bf48a1a250a758e74120f1781c78812"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:17f5ed17156a675ccbfa94a202128a0247c867f94dd74458d458977c8ecb8ca5","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Cooper, Rex, Charlie","evidence":"[D12:1 | 10:05 am on 11 July, 2023] Andrew: Hey! So much has changed since last time we talked - meet Toby, my puppy. He's a bundle of joy and I couldn't resist taking him home, city living and all. How've you been?\n[D24:6 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Andrew: I named him Buddy because he's my buddy and I hope him and Toby become buddies!\n[D28:8 | 9:02 am on 22 November, 2023] Andrew: It took us a while to decide, but we ended up going with 'Scout' for our pup - it seemed perfect for their adventurous spirit.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bc3dd010-beb7-57e5-96bb-75d157f42ce9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f26b50a605a9c9abdb092283956861a9c2f0a9815339c9fbf96fc80342f1200b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are the names of Andrew's dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Toby, Scout, Buddy","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f26b50a605a9c9abdb092283956861a9c2f0a9815339c9fbf96fc80342f1200b"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}